{"identifier":"20230120_20230120_0302","title":"Naruto Shippuden TV Series Non-Fillers Cut (480p) - Japanese Audio and ENG-US Subs","description":"Naruto Shippuden TV Series Non-Fillers Cut (480p) - Japanese Audio and ENG-US SubsHOME VIDEO ONLY!COPYRIGHTS RESERVED TO VIZ.","videoUrl":"https://archive.org/download/20230120_20230120_0302/Ep.%20106.mp4","thumbnailUrl":"https://archive.org/services/img/20230120_20230120_0302","sourcePageUrl":"https://archive.org/details/20230120_20230120_0302","durationMs":1767200,"level":"C1","topic":"naruto","sourceCredit":"Source: Internet Archive — Naruto Shippuden TV Series Non-Fillers Cut (480p) - Japanese Audio and ENG-US Subs","hasCaptions":true,"segments":[{"startMs":92190,"endMs":97450,"text":"Homecoming Did you find it?"},{"startMs":98030,"endMs":99780,"text":"All clear here."},{"startMs":100450,"endMs":101950,"text":"Target spotted!"},{"startMs":111460,"endMs":114460,"text":"This is bad! It'll get into the village!"},{"startMs":114460,"endMs":116470,"text":"No way will we let it get away!"},{"startMs":129020,"endMs":130400,"text":"What is this?!"},{"startMs":131150,"endMs":132440,"text":"Where'd it go?"},{"startMs":132440,"endMs":133440,"text":"That way!"},{"startMs":134780,"endMs":136280,"text":"Hey, you squirts!"},{"startMs":137820,"endMs":138780,"text":"Hey!"},{"startMs":139660,"endMs":140950,"text":"We're sorry!"},{"startMs":141370,"endMs":142660,"text":"What're you doing?!"},{"startMs":142660,"endMs":144120,"text":"Sorry!"},{"startMs":147040,"endMs":148120,"text":"Sorry about that."},{"startMs":150250,"endMs":152040,"text":"I'm going out for a small delivery."},{"startMs":153710,"endMs":154500,"text":"Outta the way!"},{"startMs":160970,"endMs":162640,"text":"Sorry, pops!"},{"startMs":162640,"endMs":164140,"text":"Hey, Naruto!"},{"startMs":166430,"endMs":168770,"text":"No, I mean..."},{"startMs":168770,"endMs":170900,"text":"Konohamaru!"},{"startMs":182530,"endMs":185490,"text":"Konohamaru, we've cornered the target."},{"startMs":187120,"endMs":188200,"text":"Hurry up!"},{"startMs":188790,"endMs":190830,"text":"It'll get away!"},{"startMs":191670,"endMs":192710,"text":"No problem!"},{"startMs":198630,"endMs":199380,"text":"Why you!"},{"startMs":199550,"endMs":201340,"text":"Give it up already!"},{"startMs":200090,"endMs":201340,"text":"Konohamaru!"},{"startMs":205600,"endMs":207970,"text":"I got him!"},{"startMs":208470,"endMs":212100,"text":"A ribbon on the right ear... No doubt about it."},{"startMs":212100,"endMs":216150,"text":"Ebisu-sensei, we captured the lost pet target \"Tora\"."},{"startMs":217150,"endMs":219030,"text":"Mission complete!"},{"startMs":226870,"endMs":229330,"text":"My adorable Tora!"},{"startMs":229330,"endMs":231620,"text":"I was worried to death about you."},{"startMs":231620,"endMs":233580,"text":"Where were you?"},{"startMs":234000,"endMs":238050,"text":"I'd want to run away too, if an old lady like that were my owner..."},{"startMs":238250,"endMs":239760,"text":"Konohamaru!"},{"startMs":241470,"endMs":244050,"text":"All right, here is the reward."},{"startMs":244050,"endMs":246890,"text":"Now then, let's go home, Tora."},{"startMs":251890,"endMs":255940,"text":"How many hours did it take you guys to catch a simple lost cat?!"},{"startMs":255940,"endMs":259690,"text":"But that cat was incredibly quick..."},{"startMs":259690,"endMs":261570,"text":"And he seemed accustomed to running away..."},{"startMs":261570,"endMs":263110,"text":"I don't want to hear any excuses!"},{"startMs":263110,"endMs":268410,"text":"A mission like this must be carried out more quickly and properly!"},{"startMs":268410,"endMs":269830,"text":"You guys are not good enough!"},{"startMs":270200,"endMs":274370,"text":"I can't display my true strength on a lame mission like this!"},{"startMs":275040,"endMs":279250,"text":"Say, Iruka-sensei. Don't you have any better missions?"},{"startMs":279250,"endMs":281420,"text":"Listen, Konohamaru..."},{"startMs":281420,"endMs":285680,"text":"Konohamaru, you guys just became Genin."},{"startMs":285680,"endMs":288930,"text":"There's no way I can give missions like that to you right off the bat, right?!"},{"startMs":288930,"endMs":291470,"text":"It'll be D-rank missions until further notice."},{"startMs":291470,"endMs":294230,"text":"I can't be satisfied with that!"},{"startMs":294230,"endMs":297190,"text":"After all, in the future I'm going to become the Seventh Hokage."},{"startMs":297190,"endMs":300190,"text":"Seventh? Not the Sixth?"},{"startMs":300690,"endMs":303360,"text":"Naruto's going to be the Sixth."},{"startMs":312490,"endMs":314710,"text":"Naruto, huh?"},{"startMs":315120,"endMs":317540,"text":"I wonder where he is right now..."},{"startMs":317540,"endMs":321500,"text":"I bet he'll return having become an awesome shinobi."},{"startMs":322000,"endMs":324260,"text":"I have faith in him!"},{"startMs":328140,"endMs":332680,"text":"He's more of a Second Naruto than a Seventh Hokage..."},{"startMs":334180,"endMs":337190,"text":"Naruto... Are you holding up okay?"},{"startMs":338770,"endMs":342900,"text":"No matter what, I'll get strong and bring Sasuke back!"},{"startMs":344860,"endMs":350740,"text":"Quite a bit of time has passed since he said that and went off for real training with Master Jiraiya..."},{"startMs":350740,"endMs":355000,"text":"Yes. Isn't it just about the time he should be returning?"},{"startMs":356580,"endMs":359040,"text":"We need him to return."},{"startMs":359750,"endMs":363300,"text":"After all, there will probably be significant developments sometime soon."},{"startMs":384360,"endMs":387570,"text":"Hey, could that be...?"},{"startMs":387570,"endMs":390070,"text":"Yeah... No doubt about it."},{"startMs":393240,"endMs":394830,"text":"Sakura!"},{"startMs":398080,"endMs":399290,"text":"Konohamaru?"},{"startMs":399290,"endMs":400960,"text":"Where are you off to?"},{"startMs":400960,"endMs":402710,"text":"The main village gate."},{"startMs":402710,"endMs":406880,"text":"I have to pick up the morning pedestrian traffic ledger for Lady Tsunade."},{"startMs":407300,"endMs":408380,"text":"You want to come?"},{"startMs":409550,"endMs":411800,"text":"It's been about two and a half years."},{"startMs":411800,"endMs":414050,"text":"Yeah, it has..."},{"startMs":415510,"endMs":418890,"text":"And then that Tora cat suddenly starts scratching me like crazy!"},{"startMs":419560,"endMs":421690,"text":"We had missions like that, too."},{"startMs":421690,"endMs":423730,"text":"It kind of takes me back."},{"startMs":423730,"endMs":427570,"text":"Come to think of it, have you heard anything from Naruto?!"},{"startMs":427570,"endMs":430150,"text":"Nothing... yet."},{"startMs":430150,"endMs":431410,"text":"I see..."},{"startMs":432610,"endMs":435530,"text":"He should be coming back soon, though..."},{"startMs":439870,"endMs":443080,"text":"Hello, Izumo, Kotetsu."},{"startMs":443080,"endMs":444590,"text":"Oh, look who's here..."},{"startMs":445590,"endMs":447340,"text":"Why don't you head on into town?"},{"startMs":447340,"endMs":449670,"text":"You'll see something interesting."},{"startMs":449670,"endMs":451260,"text":"Something interesting?"},{"startMs":453300,"endMs":454260,"text":"Don't tell me!"},{"startMs":461350,"endMs":463310,"text":"He's having a ball..."},{"startMs":465770,"endMs":468190,"text":"This takes me back!"},{"startMs":468190,"endMs":471030,"text":"The village hasn't changed a bit!"},{"startMs":471490,"endMs":478370,"text":"Everyone! Naruto Uzumaki's back!"},{"startMs":481750,"endMs":485130,"text":"It's all so nostalgic..."},{"startMs":489880,"endMs":492800,"text":"They added Grandma Tsunade's Mountainside Image!"},{"startMs":497970,"endMs":499260,"text":"For real?"},{"startMs":499600,"endMs":500680,"text":"For real!"},{"startMs":502270,"endMs":503390,"text":"Naruto?"},{"startMs":504230,"endMs":505350,"text":"Is that you, Naruto?"},{"startMs":507020,"endMs":509980,"text":"When did you get back, Naruto?"},{"startMs":510320,"endMs":512320,"text":"Just now!"},{"startMs":514280,"endMs":516990,"text":"Long time no see, Sakura!"},{"startMs":523210,"endMs":526380,"text":"You've gotten taller than me, haven't you?"},{"startMs":528960,"endMs":529840,"text":"You're right."},{"startMs":531050,"endMs":535340,"text":"He kind of... got a build since I last saw him..."},{"startMs":536340,"endMs":540260,"text":"So? You think I've become a bit womanly?"},{"startMs":540260,"endMs":543520,"text":"You're fine! You haven't changed a bit."},{"startMs":547230,"endMs":551980,"text":"You just don't understand the heart of a woman..."},{"startMs":551980,"endMs":553610,"text":"Naruto!"},{"startMs":557910,"endMs":559450,"text":"Oiroke no Jutsu!"},{"startMs":557910,"endMs":567460,"text":"(Oiroke no Jutsu: Sexy Technique) How about that?! Pretty nice waist, hips and bust, huh?!"},{"startMs":571550,"endMs":576010,"text":"Konohamaru... I'm not a kid anymore."},{"startMs":576680,"endMs":580760,"text":"And you too, shouldn't be using techniques like that..."},{"startMs":584640,"endMs":589560,"text":"That's right. It isn't just your appearance that's matured..."},{"startMs":590860,"endMs":596360,"text":"I kind of feel a bit lonesome, but you've turned out quite admirable, haven't you, Naruto?"},{"startMs":596360,"endMs":601410,"text":"Knowing you, I bet you came back having acquired some incredible techniques."},{"startMs":602030,"endMs":604790,"text":"That's such a boring technique!"},{"startMs":604790,"endMs":609040,"text":"Check out my freshly developed pervy ninjutsu!"},{"startMs":609040,"endMs":611630,"text":"Right... Like a new pervy ninjutsu..."},{"startMs":611630,"endMs":613920,"text":"Here we go!"},{"startMs":616380,"endMs":619010,"text":"Hey, you idiot!"},{"startMs":630310,"endMs":633360,"text":"You haven't changed at all, have you, you jerk?!"},{"startMs":633360,"endMs":634780,"text":"After seeing each other for the first time in like two years!"},{"startMs":634780,"endMs":637570,"text":"You make me do this in barely two minutes!"},{"startMs":637570,"endMs":641780,"text":"What am I supposed to do with the feelings of admiration I had for you earlier, huh?!"},{"startMs":641780,"endMs":644790,"text":"That short temper and incredible strength."},{"startMs":641950,"endMs":644280,"text":"I'm not the least bit lonesome!"},{"startMs":644790,"endMs":647250,"text":"She's a second-generation Tsunade."},{"startMs":645120,"endMs":647250,"text":"Huh? God, I'm mad at myself!"},{"startMs":647660,"endMs":650460,"text":"Just like I thought, Sakura hasn't changed at all..."},{"startMs":650460,"endMs":653710,"text":"In fact, I get the feeling she's even more vicious than before..."},{"startMs":653710,"endMs":656170,"text":"Huh? Did you say something?"},{"startMs":657260,"endMs":659380,"text":"It's been a long time, you two."},{"startMs":659760,"endMs":662140,"text":"I'm sure your training produced good results, right?"},{"startMs":662470,"endMs":666260,"text":"Do you think we came back without making progress?"},{"startMs":666260,"endMs":667970,"text":"It went perfectly!"},{"startMs":668680,"endMs":671350,"text":"Then show me those results immediately."},{"startMs":671850,"endMs":673060,"text":"Show you?"},{"startMs":673440,"endMs":675570,"text":"You will take on a particular man."},{"startMs":676110,"endMs":680780,"text":"I didn't send him on any missions for the past several days and had him stand by for this very purpose."},{"startMs":681570,"endMs":683240,"text":"Your opponent will be..."},{"startMs":685280,"endMs":685870,"text":"Come in!"},{"startMs":689460,"endMs":690500,"text":"Hello."},{"startMs":693920,"endMs":697590,"text":"Shikamaru! Temari! Look who's here!"},{"startMs":699880,"endMs":701050,"text":"Naruto..."},{"startMs":701050,"endMs":703340,"text":"Hey! That is you, isn't it, Naruto?"},{"startMs":704510,"endMs":705390,"text":"Shikamaru!"},{"startMs":705970,"endMs":708520,"text":"This is... that little shrimp?"},{"startMs":708560,"endMs":711060,"text":"So you're back?"},{"startMs":711060,"endMs":713020,"text":"Yeah, I got back this morning."},{"startMs":714150,"endMs":716360,"text":"You don't look as stupid as before..."},{"startMs":716860,"endMs":720320,"text":"I mean, hey, have you changed?"},{"startMs":722530,"endMs":724530,"text":"No, he hasn't."},{"startMs":724530,"endMs":725660,"text":"Oh... I thought so."},{"startMs":726450,"endMs":728490,"text":"Sakura..."},{"startMs":734750,"endMs":737670,"text":"Then, does this mean you're my opponent, Shikamaru?"},{"startMs":737670,"endMs":740670,"text":"Opponent? What do you mean?"},{"startMs":740670,"endMs":742970,"text":"I just came to deliver some documents."},{"startMs":743630,"endMs":745510,"text":"Huh? You're not my opponent, Shikamaru?"},{"startMs":745510,"endMs":746550,"text":"Then..."},{"startMs":749510,"endMs":750640,"text":"Who're you again?"},{"startMs":750640,"endMs":752140,"text":"You don't remember me?"},{"startMs":752140,"endMs":755100,"text":"Naruto, that's not your opponent."},{"startMs":756150,"endMs":757150,"text":"He's out there."},{"startMs":765530,"endMs":767990,"text":"You sure got tall... Naruto."},{"startMs":770040,"endMs":770740,"text":"Yo!"},{"startMs":773160,"endMs":774500,"text":"Kakashi-sensei!"},{"startMs":775670,"endMs":783130,"text":"Akatsuki Makes Its Move Sensei, you haven't changed one bit!"},{"startMs":783550,"endMs":784670,"text":"Oh yeah."},{"startMs":785130,"endMs":787340,"text":"Listen, listen..."},{"startMs":787340,"endMs":790350,"text":"I've got a present for you."},{"startMs":791970,"endMs":794100,"text":"This is sure a nostalgic sight."},{"startMs":794100,"endMs":794810,"text":"Yes, it is..."},{"startMs":794810,"endMs":797020,"text":"What?!"},{"startMs":797850,"endMs":800150,"text":"You got me... Th-This is..."},{"startMs":802230,"endMs":806490,"text":"This is the first new title in the Make-Out series in three years!"},{"startMs":806490,"endMs":809280,"text":"I think it's totally boring, but you like this stuff, don't you, Sensei?!"},{"startMs":810580,"endMs":811740,"text":"That idiot..."},{"startMs":811740,"endMs":815000,"text":"No way could a kid understand the appeal."},{"startMs":815000,"endMs":818750,"text":"And on top of that, it's a very rare item that hasn't even been released yet..."},{"startMs":823840,"endMs":827590,"text":"All right! That's enough fun for now, Kakashi."},{"startMs":833770,"endMs":834930,"text":"Don't tell me..."},{"startMs":834930,"endMs":836440,"text":"Are you my opponent?"},{"startMs":838310,"endMs":840150,"text":"Not quite..."},{"startMs":844030,"endMs":847700,"text":"Gee, it's been a while since I saw you too, Sakura."},{"startMs":847700,"endMs":849620,"text":"Yes, it has, Kakashi-sensei."},{"startMs":850070,"endMs":852080,"text":"My opponent will be..."},{"startMs":855370,"endMs":856750,"text":"Naruto... and Sakura."},{"startMs":857960,"endMs":859330,"text":"The both of you!"},{"startMs":861250,"endMs":863210,"text":"Kakashi-sensei's our opponent..."},{"startMs":863710,"endMs":866420,"text":"I want to see what you can do against Kakashi..."},{"startMs":866880,"endMs":871140,"text":"I will determine your status in the future based on the results."},{"startMs":872220,"endMs":873600,"text":"Status, eh?"},{"startMs":873600,"endMs":878310,"text":"Sakura, show me that you weren't just wasting your time training under me."},{"startMs":879100,"endMs":879850,"text":"Yes, ma'am!"},{"startMs":879850,"endMs":882270,"text":"Then, shall we get right to it?"},{"startMs":883610,"endMs":885690,"text":"That's what I'd like to say."},{"startMs":886320,"endMs":889070,"text":"But since you just got back Naruto, you must be tired."},{"startMs":889400,"endMs":890780,"text":"I'll give you a short rest."},{"startMs":891200,"endMs":893780,"text":"I'm not particularly tired or anything!"},{"startMs":894870,"endMs":897500,"text":"Let's meet up at the Third Training Grounds later."},{"startMs":897500,"endMs":898200,"text":"See ya."},{"startMs":900370,"endMs":902840,"text":"Why's he in such a hurry?"},{"startMs":904960,"endMs":907170,"text":"I have a pretty good idea..."},{"startMs":907170,"endMs":909130,"text":"He's going to read his book."},{"startMs":910430,"endMs":913050,"text":"With that look he had, there's no doubt about it."},{"startMs":913680,"endMs":919060,"text":"That's the obvious reaction after getting an unreleased copy of one of my books."},{"startMs":921310,"endMs":923310,"text":"That Kakashi-sensei."},{"startMs":923310,"endMs":928110,"text":"Is that stupid book more important to him than the results of our training?"},{"startMs":928110,"endMs":933070,"text":"Well, now we can discuss our strategy against Kakashi-sensei."},{"startMs":935660,"endMs":938500,"text":"So, are you guys on a date?"},{"startMs":939290,"endMs":940960,"text":"It's not like that."},{"startMs":942330,"endMs":943710,"text":"Cut out the jokes."},{"startMs":943710,"endMs":945380,"text":"Why would I be on a date with this guy?"},{"startMs":945750,"endMs":947670,"text":"It's almost time for the Chunin Exams."},{"startMs":947670,"endMs":952380,"text":"I've just been going back and forth between the Sand and the Leaf for meetings concerning the Exams."},{"startMs":952380,"endMs":957010,"text":"And although it's a pain, I've been put in charge of the Exams..."},{"startMs":957010,"endMs":960730,"text":"I've just been told to act as a guide for the Sand messenger."},{"startMs":962270,"endMs":964100,"text":"Chunin Exams, huh?"},{"startMs":966480,"endMs":968150,"text":"That sure takes me back..."},{"startMs":971570,"endMs":973860,"text":"So what're you going to do, Naruto?"},{"startMs":974450,"endMs":975370,"text":"About what?"},{"startMs":975370,"endMs":978410,"text":"About the Chunin Exams."},{"startMs":978910,"endMs":983370,"text":"You're the only one from our class who hasn't become a Chunin."},{"startMs":990380,"endMs":991840,"text":"What?!"},{"startMs":992380,"endMs":995010,"text":"Th-Then, you're also a Chunin, Sakura?"},{"startMs":996140,"endMs":997010,"text":"That's right."},{"startMs":997430,"endMs":1005810,"text":"And just for the record, Kankuro, this person here, and Neji who's one grade above us are already Jonin."},{"startMs":1007940,"endMs":1010900,"text":"Then what about Gaara?!"},{"startMs":1010900,"endMs":1026790,"text":"Wind Lord Kazekage... The meeting is about to begin."},{"startMs":1033260,"endMs":1034760,"text":"Okay."},{"startMs":1036050,"endMs":1037180,"text":"I see..."},{"startMs":1038140,"endMs":1040890,"text":"So Gaara became the Kazekage, huh?"},{"startMs":1045060,"endMs":1045940,"text":"That's awesome..."},{"startMs":1048310,"endMs":1050480,"text":"I won't be outdone!"},{"startMs":1056860,"endMs":1059320,"text":"I'll become the Hokage, no matter what!"},{"startMs":1059700,"endMs":1061530,"text":"Just you wait, Gaara!"},{"startMs":1065910,"endMs":1068580,"text":"I guess... he has matured a little, after all."},{"startMs":1079390,"endMs":1082180,"text":"What do you think?! Pretty good, huh?"},{"startMs":1084520,"endMs":1087140,"text":"It is my finest work."},{"startMs":1095740,"endMs":1099530,"text":"I leave Naruto in your care as promised..."},{"startMs":1100120,"endMs":1103990,"text":"It'd be nice if he's grown at least a little."},{"startMs":1105370,"endMs":1107460,"text":"You'd think I've slipped up?"},{"startMs":1108000,"endMs":1110960,"text":"You'll get beaten out if you get careless."},{"startMs":1110960,"endMs":1112630,"text":"Well, that's encouraging to hear."},{"startMs":1114500,"endMs":1117340,"text":"And their actions are gaining momentum."},{"startMs":1122180,"endMs":1130650,"text":"Over the past several years, the strength of our village has stabilized, and relations with the Hidden Villages in each allied land have prospered."},{"startMs":1131650,"endMs":1139360,"text":"In particular, we have achieved good results in our development of recruits with the curriculum incorporating the training program from the Leaf Village."},{"startMs":1139360,"endMs":1142120,"text":"The Chunin Exams are almost here."},{"startMs":1142120,"endMs":1144280,"text":"I look forward to the results."},{"startMs":1144280,"endMs":1149790,"text":"However... at this time, with the Chunin Exams upon us, there is a nasty rumor going around..."},{"startMs":1150080,"endMs":1151750,"text":"What is it, Yura?"},{"startMs":1152580,"endMs":1157210,"text":"Have you heard of the organization called the \"Akatsuki\"?"},{"startMs":1165600,"endMs":1167020,"text":"I see..."},{"startMs":1167020,"endMs":1168890,"text":"So they're finally making their move."},{"startMs":1168890,"endMs":1172310,"text":"It's something we were expecting to a degree, though."},{"startMs":1173980,"endMs":1175400,"text":"The Akatsuki, huh?"},{"startMs":1176480,"endMs":1182360,"text":"The Akatsuki is a mysterious organization composed of a dozen or so shinobi."},{"startMs":1183320,"endMs":1188620,"text":"The members of the organization are vicious S-Rank criminals all listed in the Bingo Book."},{"startMs":1189160,"endMs":1191420,"text":"Of those identified..."},{"startMs":1191420,"endMs":1199420,"text":"There is Itachi Uchiha from the Village Hidden in the Leaves who drove his own clan to annihilation in one night."},{"startMs":1199880,"endMs":1203010,"text":"There is Kisame Hoshigaki who was once a member of the Seven Ninja Swordsmen of the Mist."},{"startMs":1203010,"endMs":1206390,"text":"He was known as the phantom of the Mist."},{"startMs":1207100,"endMs":1212810,"text":"And there is Orochimaru who once plotted the destruction of the Leaf and assassinated the previous Kazekage."},{"startMs":1213100,"endMs":1216730,"text":"It is said he used to be a member of this organization."},{"startMs":1221240,"endMs":1225320,"text":"Why have they started taking such dramatic action?"},{"startMs":1225320,"endMs":1226280,"text":"What's their goal?"},{"startMs":1226280,"endMs":1229080,"text":"That's beyond me at this point..."},{"startMs":1229080,"endMs":1230700,"text":"What I do know..."},{"startMs":1234750,"endMs":1238210,"text":"...is that they're after what's inside Naruto."},{"startMs":1238500,"endMs":1243300,"text":"And... that they've got something evil in mind."},{"startMs":1244010,"endMs":1248100,"text":"I passed on this information to those in charge of security for each land."},{"startMs":1248100,"endMs":1252060,"text":"I sure hope they tighten up their security immediately."},{"startMs":1260860,"endMs":1262360,"text":"I see..."},{"startMs":1262360,"endMs":1264780,"text":"I'd heard the rumors..."},{"startMs":1265110,"endMs":1267280,"text":"So the organization in question is finally taking action..."},{"startMs":1268580,"endMs":1273460,"text":"The source of the information is Lord Jiraiya, one of the legendary Sannin."},{"startMs":1273460,"endMs":1278920,"text":"So prior to the meeting, I took the liberty of issuing an order to increase Village security."},{"startMs":1279340,"endMs":1283630,"text":"Anbu Black Ops masters have already been stationed at key points around the village."},{"startMs":1284260,"endMs":1289600,"text":"No matter how powerful the shinobi may be, they will not be able to infiltrate by force."},{"startMs":1290310,"endMs":1296520,"text":"I hear the members of the Akatsuki wear black clothing in addition to capes with red cloud pattern on them."},{"startMs":1297020,"endMs":1301730,"text":"I ordered security to attack with full force should they see someone fitting that description."},{"startMs":1305150,"endMs":1308240,"text":"Now then... the meeting is adjourned."},{"startMs":1317920,"endMs":1320170,"text":"Well done, Yura."},{"startMs":1320170,"endMs":1322130,"text":"I never thought you'd take action so quickly."},{"startMs":1323460,"endMs":1327340,"text":"I have also served as a superior for four years."},{"startMs":1327720,"endMs":1329140,"text":"It is my intention..."},{"startMs":1329550,"endMs":1331760,"text":"...to always make decisions while considering..."},{"startMs":1333010,"endMs":1337230,"text":"...what's in the best interest of the... village."},{"startMs":1348610,"endMs":1349780,"text":"What's the matter?"},{"startMs":1349780,"endMs":1352410,"text":"Nothing... It's nothing at all..."},{"startMs":1352830,"endMs":1354700,"text":"I just haven't slept much..."},{"startMs":1354700,"endMs":1358040,"text":"I see... You need to take care of yourself."},{"startMs":1358040,"endMs":1359580,"text":"Thank you for your concern."},{"startMs":1363000,"endMs":1365590,"text":"I see... That's right..."},{"startMs":1378680,"endMs":1383480,"text":"I see. So we have to deal with this one, then go after the guy we sent to Orochimaru, huh?"},{"startMs":1383860,"endMs":1389150,"text":"It seems he turned traitor and leaked information about us."},{"startMs":1389860,"endMs":1392410,"text":"It can't be helped."},{"startMs":1392410,"endMs":1395830,"text":"Even I don't know what happens after the technique is cast."},{"startMs":1396540,"endMs":1399790,"text":"More importantly, will just that bag be enough?"},{"startMs":1400170,"endMs":1403040,"text":"Our opponent will be using the Jinchuuriki."},{"startMs":1404790,"endMs":1407510,"text":"All of my techniques are works of art."},{"startMs":1408840,"endMs":1411630,"text":"And I made sure to bring my specialty."},{"startMs":1415260,"endMs":1419100,"text":"After all, our opponent is the One-Tailed."},{"startMs":1433570,"endMs":1448300,"text":"Third Training Grounds Is Kakashi-sensei going to make us wait forever?!"},{"startMs":1448300,"endMs":1450340,"text":"Well, he's always been like this."},{"startMs":1451420,"endMs":1452720,"text":"Geez!"},{"startMs":1452720,"endMs":1454840,"text":"It'd be nice if he'd show a little improvement."},{"startMs":1457560,"endMs":1459390,"text":"Oh, sorry about that."},{"startMs":1459390,"endMs":1462020,"text":"As it happens, I ran into an old woman in trouble on my way here and..."},{"startMs":1462020,"endMs":1462980,"text":"Okay! That's a lie!"},{"startMs":1470690,"endMs":1473280,"text":"This place... kind of takes me back."},{"startMs":1478950,"endMs":1483870,"text":"Your task for today is to take these bells away from me by this afternoon."},{"startMs":1484370,"endMs":1486580,"text":"Those unable to get a bell will get no lunch."},{"startMs":1487420,"endMs":1492300,"text":"You'll be tied to those posts and then I'll eat your lunch right in front of you."},{"startMs":1496930,"endMs":1502230,"text":"Oh, come to think of it, this was your first Training Ground, wasn't it?"},{"startMs":1503770,"endMs":1505190,"text":"Squad Seven..."},{"startMs":1506690,"endMs":1508520,"text":"The Three-Man Squad, huh?"},{"startMs":1510650,"endMs":1514150,"text":"We had Sasuke with us... back then, didn't we?"},{"startMs":1519160,"endMs":1520120,"text":"Don't go!"},{"startMs":1521790,"endMs":1523910,"text":"If you do, I'll scream!"},{"startMs":1528080,"endMs":1529170,"text":"Sakura."},{"startMs":1534170,"endMs":1535170,"text":"Thanks."},{"startMs":1543020,"endMs":1545640,"text":"Sasuke."},{"startMs":1550110,"endMs":1551270,"text":"Sasuke!"},{"startMs":1560280,"endMs":1564040,"text":"Yo, goofball."},{"startMs":1572090,"endMs":1575420,"text":"Sasuke's name is off limits for these guys..."},{"startMs":1581850,"endMs":1585180,"text":"Well... Let's see how much you've grown."},{"startMs":1585180,"endMs":1587600,"text":"You haven't given up on Sasuke, have you?"},{"startMs":1587600,"endMs":1589060,"text":"Absolutely not!"},{"startMs":1589060,"endMs":1592070,"text":"That's why I continued my training!"},{"startMs":1594900,"endMs":1597990,"text":"The rules are the same as when we first met."},{"startMs":1598660,"endMs":1602450,"text":"I don't care how you do it. Just take a bell away from me."},{"startMs":1603870,"endMs":1604490,"text":"If you don't..."},{"startMs":1604490,"endMs":1608710,"text":"...\"come at me with the intent to kill,\" ...\"you won't be able to get the bells\", right?"},{"startMs":1610290,"endMs":1612880,"text":"You can use Shuriken if you want."},{"startMs":1612880,"endMs":1616300,"text":"If you don't come at me with the intent to kill, you won't be able to get the bells."},{"startMs":1619010,"endMs":1620220,"text":"Exactly."},{"startMs":1620930,"endMs":1624010,"text":"If you don't come at me with the intent to kill, you won't be able to get the bells."},{"startMs":1624010,"endMs":1626430,"text":"You have until sunrise tomorrow."},{"startMs":1634400,"endMs":1636570,"text":"Now then, shall we begin?"},{"startMs":1637900,"endMs":1642280,"text":"You're not going to do it while reading your book this time around, Kakashi-sensei?"},{"startMs":1642660,"endMs":1645790,"text":"Or have you already finished reading?"},{"startMs":1646490,"endMs":1650670,"text":"Nope... I thought I'd save the fun for later..."},{"startMs":1651000,"endMs":1654670,"text":"Besides... Well, I kind of get the feeling..."},{"startMs":1655040,"endMs":1656880,"text":"...I may have to..."},{"startMs":1658590,"endMs":1661630,"text":"...get a bit serious this time around."},{"startMs":1678530,"endMs":1679440,"text":"What's that?"},{"startMs":1683860,"endMs":1686370,"text":"Black clothing and a red cloud pattern."},{"startMs":1686740,"endMs":1687540,"text":"Don't tell me..."},{"startMs":1688370,"endMs":1689370,"text":"Is that..."},{"startMs":1689660,"endMs":1692040,"text":"Contact Captain Yura immediately!"},{"startMs":1693040,"endMs":1696420,"text":"Captain Yura! Some guys from the organization in question have shown up."},{"startMs":1696420,"endMs":1697550,"text":"I know."},{"startMs":1698550,"endMs":1701510,"text":"You don't need to worry... It'll be over soon."},{"startMs":1721440,"endMs":1723610,"text":"Good work, Yura."},{"startMs":1724110,"endMs":1727080,"text":"Do you remember me?"},{"startMs":1727620,"endMs":1729700,"text":"Yes, Lord Sasori!"},{"startMs":1765490,"endMs":1767200,"text":"Let's go!"}]}